      "relativePublishTimeDescription": "4 года назад",
      "rating": 5,
      "text": {
        "text": "Hello, I would like assistance with one of your previous patient named Zeljko Franovic. His assigned care taker was Dr. Fedja, who he used to talk alot about with love and care. It seems they had a close relationship. Zeljko commited a crime and killed a stray cat named Starboy, which was burried near the Kotor coast using a rusty spoon. If you can give me any information about him I would appreciate it. Zeljko is my cousin, and I worry about him and his mother Slavica. He hits her hard everyday, and is very instable. Please help me spread this message and find Zeljko and help him. Thanks. Love from Titovgrad.",
        "languageCode": "en"
      },
      "originalText": {
